{
  "name": "SUB · Issue refund (B4)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SUB · Issue refund\nLesson Boss 4 (from 4.5). The ONLY route to Paystack. Inputs: order_id, amount, reason (from the agent) and chat_id (from the trigger, never the model).\n1. Hard limits in code: owner, paid, not refunded, ≤ order total, ≤ ₦50,000.\n2. Tolu approves or rejects on Telegram, with full context.\n3. Only then: Paystack refund (TEST key), mark the order refunded, log the decision.\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2; Telegram API; Header Auth \"Paystack test\" (Name Authorization, Value Bearer + your TEST secret key).\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (3 Sheets nodes); YOUR_TOLU_CHAT_ID.\nOrders needs columns paystack_ref (the transaction reference) and refunded. Decisions columns: time, order_id, chat_id, amount, reason, decision, detail, paystack_ref.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "066bb73f-be76-4fb7-b066-a80253a521b5",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
