    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### The money path\nTrigger → limits → Tolu's tap → Paystack. There is no other way to reach the Paystack node. Never put a live key in the Paystack test credential.\n\nThe lesson adds human review on the agent's tools connector. This template puts the same Telegram approval inside the sub-workflow (Send and Wait for Response), so the approval is on the money path whichever agent calls it. If your n8n offers human review for tools, you can use it as well, with the lesson's message.",
